  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0: initial preview release. JWT auth (access + refresh, rotation and reuse detection), 2FA (TOTP/email), Google social login, full account lifecycle, rate limiting and native OpenAPI docs. Dynamic RBAC: permissions are discovered from your own endpoints too (any root namespace following the Features.Feature.Action convention); the sync reports endpoints it cannot name and rejects duplicate keys across slices. The seeded AdminAutoDiscoveryIAM role administers users, roles and permissions from day one; IsSuAdmin/IsDevelopment are database-only. Upgrades keep your data: your migrations cover the schema, and the package applies its own data changes once on startup. Validated end-to-end from a clean external project, including an upgrade. MIT licensed.",
